 *
 * This component provides code diff visualization for Minotaur.
 * It displays side-by-side and inline diff views.
 *
 * Usage:
 * <CodeDiffVisualization OldCode="..." NewCode="..." />
 *
 * Features:
 * - Side-by-side comparison
 * - Inline diff view
 * - Syntax-aware diffing
 * - Change highlighting
 * - Navigation between changes
 * - Keyboard shortcuts
 *
 * Dependencies:
 * - Minotaur.Core.Services.Diff.CodeDiffService
 * - Minotaur.Core.Models.Diff.DiffModels
 *
